{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI have reached Brussels safely and am staying with van Ghert. The house is comfortable, and Madame van Ghert, a kind soul, insisted on cutting my quill pen herself. It is a small gesture, but it reminds me that one finds hospitality not only in grand salons but in the quiet domesticity of good friends.\n\nI fetched our letter from the post office. It is a relief to hold your handwriting after the dust of the road. The journey is wearying, yet the change of air is good. I think of you and the boys often, especially as I sit in this quiet room. Please do not worry about my health; I am merely tired. I look forward to returning to Berlin, where the air is cleaner and the cards sharper.\n\nGive my love to Karl and Immanuel.\n\nYour affectionate,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080611,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":182,"prompt_tokens":915,"total_tokens":1097,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-CaTYacBjJ9q20QhC9turkqqH14WH5Wei","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":915,"prompt_ms":920.691,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0062196721311476,"prompt_per_second":993.8187730737022,"predicted_n":182,"predicted_ms":4328.436,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.914011049723754,"predicted_per_second":41.81648983605164}}